# Olympus: climb to the plateau through a long banked curve, a hairpin up there, down into
# a dirt section with a U-berm, a steep climb to a jump that lands in a descent, then a
# technical finish. No straight longer than two cells except the jump run-up.
# The jump is a kicker: the 3-cell climb (its 187 m crest keeps the car on its wheels, so it
# takes off from the lip) ends on a 20° ramp 22 m up, which throws the car 7 m higher and about
# a second through the air over the landing hill, then down two levels. The bend after the
# landing and the last one are berms: the car comes down at 275 km/h, and a turn banked about
# its centreline would sink its inside half under the ground at level 0.
name Olympus
seed 31337
# 4: the technical finish lined with bumpers, the tarp strapped (the start keeps its sandbags).
version 4
start 0 0 0 0
turn2_right
slope3_up1
banked3_left
slope2_up1
turn1_right
turn2_left
checkpoint
slope3_down2
turn2_right
to_dirt
berm2_left dirt
whoops2 dirt
uberm2_right dirt
checkpoint dirt
turn2_left dirt
to_road
slope3_up2
kicker
kicker_landing5_down2
berm3_right bumpers
turn1_left bumpers
berm2_right bumpers
finish bumpers

# The colony's scenery (crates/track/src/camp.rs): a base camp beside the start, a post by the
# raised hairpin, a mast, a field camp in the dirt loop, two caches, and the colony on a mesa of
# its own to the north-east, ahead and to the left of the long climb to the kicker.
landform mesa -880 960 90 50 460 90
structure base_camp 110 40 -90
structure post -150 300 0
structure mast -430 230 0
structure field_camp -450 560 0
structure cache -330 510 180
structure cache -960 300 90
structure colony -880 960 90
